<title>USA: Port conditions update - U.S. - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - U.S. - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>UNITED STATES, July 17 - Los Angeles - Operations have reverted to normal after port authorities secured a temporary restraining order that barred 11 striking port pilots from picketing terminals.</p>
</text>
